{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":174412,"duration_api_ms":184693,"num_turns":22,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9dd597a2-65ff-4000-8005-c15515c95cd3","total_cost_usd":0.8469743,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59192,"cache_read_input_tokens":447937,"output_tokens":5642,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59192,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5202,"outputTokens":6634,"cacheReadInputTokens":327413,"cacheCreationInputTokens":32678,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1119608,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":5642,"cacheReadInputTokens":447937,"cacheCreationInputTokens":59192,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.7350135,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 6 acceptance-criteria tests pass in tank_data (28 tests total, 0 failures): test_provenance_schema_roundtrip, test_provenance_optional_fields, test_confidence_levels_enum, test_valid_range_enforcement, test_backward_compatible_loading, test_provenance_display — plus 22 additional tests covering plant/substrate/shrimp/source-water param_meta, loader diagnostics, DIC-rate validation, and legacy formatting.","11 provenance unit tests pass in tank_core covering ConfidenceLevel roundtrip/rejection, ParamMeta display (full/empty/notes), range check (in-range, out-of-range, no-range, non-finite, invalid range), and format_param (with and without notes).","49 tank_core lib tests pass, 4 tank_scenarios lib tests pass, 19 shrimp_population integration tests pass, 12 validation integration tests pass — no regressions detected.","Amendment fr-4-5f46d44d addressed: PlantPreset (presets.rs:351-363) and SubstratePreset (presets.rs:249-265) now have param_meta fields with ParamMetaPreset implementations, unknown-key validation, and loader diagnostic support.","Amendment fr-4-6586f129 addressed: provenance.rs:1-9 contains explicit module-level documentation explaining that provenance metadata lives in the preset layer, that Default::default() on runtime structs yields numeric defaults without inline provenance, and that code-defined values only carry provenance when a preset stores matching ParamMeta.","Amendment fr-4-fae98202 addressed: ShrimpPreset::lookup_param_value (presets.rs:670-703) chains .or_else(|| shrimp_runtime_default_param_value(name)) for all optional fields, falling back to ShrimpRuntimeParams::default() so format_param and check_ranges operate on effective runtime values.","Amendment fr-4-66f7e16d addressed: format_param (presets.rs:59-68) now branches on metadata presence — uses provenance_param_value (normalizing legacy fields) only when param_meta exists, otherwise uses lookup_param_value (raw value). Confirmed by test_process_preset_format_param_without_meta_keeps_raw_legacy_value.","Amendment fr-4-c056464d addressed: ProcessParamsPreset::validate() (presets.rs:1600-1605) rejects shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days <= 0.0 with explicit error. Confirmed by test process_preset_rejects_non_positive_shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days.","ParamMeta uses #[serde(deny_unknown_fields)] (provenance.rs:50) to catch metadata typos. ProcessParamsPreset, SourceWaterPreset, ShrimpPreset, PlantPreset, and SubstratePreset all validate unknown param_meta keys.","All 5 preset loaders (process, source_water, shrimp, plant, substrate) have diagnostic-aware variants (load_*_with_diagnostics) that surface range warnings via structured diagnostics. Standard loaders emit warnings to stderr.","Pre-existing clippy dead_code error in tank_core (water.rs:276 conductivity_us_cm_with_bicarbonate_total) is caused by uncommitted snapshot.rs changes from another bead — not introduced by this provenance work."],"findings_or_gaps":["No shipped TOML data files currently contain [param_meta.*] sections — the infrastructure is ready but actual metadata enrichment is deferred to downstream bead tanksim-6e5.7.2. This is by design per the bead scope.","Preset-level Provenance.confidence remains Option<String> rather than Option<ConfidenceLevel>. This is documented as intentional in presets.rs:16-20 (preset-level serves a different granularity than per-parameter), and covered by test_preset_level_provenance_confidence_is_freeform.","Pre-existing clippy failures in tank_core (dead_code from uncommitted snapshot.rs refactor) and tank_scenarios (redundant field name from tanksim-6e5.4.3-v2) are NOT introduced by this bead but will block clean cargo clippy -p tank_core -- -D warnings until those other beads' changes are committed.","check_ranges() in the ParamMetaPreset trait (presets.rs:71-74) still routes through provenance_param_value() for all metadata-backed parameters, which means legacy _mg fields get normalized before range comparison. This is correct behavior (ranges should be in normalized units) and is documented, but callers who specify valid_range on legacy _mg fields must use normalized concentration units, not raw stored units."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"5722d49e-d566-4de2-a33e-ca59affa2938"}
